---
// Student proof section, per the "Built to Last" refinement brief.
// Placed after WhyTechmedExists (the problem/system explanation) so proof
// follows the pitch, ahead of the deeper Builder/ecosystem content.
//
// The hero testimonial is condensed from a real message from TECHMED's
// 2026 UTME top scorer, Owoeye Daniella Jesudunsin (372 aggregate — ENG
// 98, CHE 98, PHY 94, BIO 82, verified against her official UTME result
// slip) — verbatim source material, not rewritten marketing copy. Her
// name and result are already public elsewhere on the site (the
// testimonials page and the legacy homepage's record section both name
// and picture her), so naming her here matches the rest of the site
// rather than introducing anything new.
//
// The photo is a portrait crop taken from her existing TECHMED record
// graphic (images/daniella-372.jpg at the repo root) rather than that
// full branded poster — the poster's glowing "HIGHEST IN NIGERIA" seal
// treatment is built for social sharing, not this page's calmer,
// institutional visual language, and the score breakdown it carries
// would just repeat the supporting line below the quote.
---

<section class="section proof">
  <p class="eyebrow">Student Proof</p>
  <h2>Built With Students. Proven By Results.</h2>

  <div class="testimonial reveal">
    <div class="photo-wrap">
      <img
        src="/images/daniella-portrait.jpg"
        alt="Owoeye Daniella Jesudunsin, TECHMED's 2026 UTME top scorer with 372"
        class="photo"
        width="700"
        height="1454"
        loading="lazy"
      />
    </div>
    <div class="quote-wrap">
      <blockquote>
        <p>&ldquo;Your tests and podcasts have been helpful.&rdquo;</p>
        <p>&ldquo;I've seen my result and I'm really proud to have you tutor me&hellip; you're one of the people I look up to.&rdquo;</p>
      </blockquote>
      <cite>Owoeye Daniella Jesudunsin <span>&mdash; 2026 UTME Top Scorer, 372</span></cite>
      <p class="supporting-line">372 in UTME 2026. Prepared within the TECHMED ecosystem.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .section {
    max-width: 960px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: var(--space-20) var(--space-6);
  }

  .eyebrow {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.15em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--accent-text);
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-4);
  }

  h2 {
    font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 4vw, 2.5rem);
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-10);
  }

  .testimonial {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 240px) 1fr;
    gap: var(--space-8);
    align-items: center;
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    padding: var(--space-8);
  }

  .photo-wrap {
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    overflow: hidden;
    box-shadow: 0 12px 32px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.25);
  }

  .photo {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    aspect-ratio: 700 / 1454;
  }

  .quote-wrap {
    border-left: 3px solid var(--accent);
    padding-left: var(--space-6);
  }

  blockquote p {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: clamp(1.1rem, 2.5vw, 1.35rem);
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--text);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-4);
  }

  blockquote p:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  cite {
    display: block;
    font-style: normal;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--text);
    margin-top: var(--space-6);
  }

  cite span {
    display: block;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--accent-text);
    margin-top: var(--space-1, 4px);
  }

  .supporting-line {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    margin-top: var(--space-2);
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .testimonial {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      padding: var(--space-6) var(--space-5);
    }

    .photo-wrap {
      max-width: 220px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .quote-wrap {
      border-left: none;
      border-top: 3px solid var(--accent);
      padding-left: 0;
      padding-top: var(--space-5);
      text-align: center;
    }
  }
</style>
